<title>UK: Nippon Steel sets 10 billion yen bond.</title>
<headline>Nippon Steel sets 10 billion yen bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Sanwa.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NIPPON STEEL CORP</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN YEN    COUPON   **1.80	MATURITY    07.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    07.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  40 BP     DENOMS (M) 100	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  30 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES    **UNTIL 07.AUG.00, STEPPING UP TO 2.20 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
